.SH NAME
QCommonStyle \- Encapsulates common Look and Feel of a GUI
\fBClasses\fR - Annotated - Tree - Functions - Home - \fBStructure\fR </div>
.br
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qcommonstyle.h>\fR
.PP
Inherits QStyle.
.PP
Inherited by QMotifStyle and QWindowsStyle.
.PP
.SS "Public Members"
.in +1c
.ti -1c
.BI "ScrollControl \fBscrollBarPointOver\fR ( const QScrollBar * " "sb" ", int " "sliderStart" ", const QPoint & p )"
.br
.in -1c
.SH DESCRIPTION
Encapsulates common Look and Feel of a GUI.
.PP
This abstract class implements some of the widget's look and feel that is common to all GUI styles provided and shipped as part of Qt.
